  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 11/09/2025 the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 11/09/2025 and numbered Unnumbered Site Location Plan, P.M.2.000, P.M.2.100, P.M.2.200, P.M.2.201, P.M.2.300, P.M.2.400, P.M.2.500, P.M.2.501 and P.M.2.600 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because:\r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class B, Paragraph (f), Part 1, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended) because the application site is located within the Spring Grove Conversation Area, on article 2(3) land. Planning permission is therefore required.\r\n"
